                <pb facs="0756" n="662" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg662"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-01-23"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Demand presented with urgent request for prompt answer, which I now await.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
